    26	
    27	- **System B must serialize kickoff itself** and **resolve the mind's CURRENT `session_key` at
    28	  execution time** (not at enqueue). The per-session `MindQueue` cannot serialize two step-0 runs
    29	  (both have no key yet). Wire continuing steps through `MindQueue`; own kickoff serialization in
    30	  System B.
    31	- Every run ends on `message.complete`; System B maps `RunResult` → ticket status. No agent-side
    32	  "blocked"/"close"; no run deadline; `errored` **stops and surfaces**, no auto-retry.
