    49	   by **querying candidate tickets only** (not a full-table rescan); a **fast path** so an approval/
    50	   unblock pokes System B immediately, with the timer as a backstop. Polls state, never the model.
    51	   "Can't proceed yet" = simply don't start the agent (no agent stop-condition).
