    67	- Frame router (`gateway.py`): response-vs-event split, payload-key-omission tolerance,
    68	  gateway.ready without session_id, id-null frames ignored, `_on_child_dead` ordering
    69	  (dead → fail pending → ready gate → event sentinel), pending registered before send — all
