orchestration/tickets/T21-dogfood-skills/codex-impl-review-raw.txt:7154:1. [skills/planning-worker.md](/Users/khushaljagota/.hermes/planning-v2/skills/planning-worker.md:10) says a write without `PLAN_RUN_ID` + `PLAN_CLAIM` is rejected as `stale_claim`. That is false for proposal/recap writes: no claim headers classify as a plain agent in [authctx.py](/Users/khushaljagota/.hermes/planning-v2/src/planner/core/authctx.py:46), and [tickets/api.py](/Users/khushaljagota/.hermes/planning-v2/src/planner/tickets/api.py:291) only calls `require_claim` when `ctx.is_claimed_agent`. Fix: say claimed worker writes must keep the env; heartbeat/close require it, but plain proposal/recap writes are permitted for non-dispatched agents.
orchestration/tickets/T21-dogfood-skills/codex-impl-review-raw.txt:7165:1. [skills/planning-worker.md](/Users/khushaljagota/.hermes/planning-v2/skills/planning-worker.md:10) says a write without `PLAN_RUN_ID` + `PLAN_CLAIM` is rejected as `stale_claim`. That is false for proposal/recap writes: no claim headers classify as a plain agent in [authctx.py](/Users/khushaljagota/.hermes/planning-v2/src/planner/core/authctx.py:46), and [tickets/api.py](/Users/khushaljagota/.hermes/planning-v2/src/planner/tickets/api.py:291) only calls `require_claim` when `ctx.is_claimed_agent`. Fix: say claimed worker writes must keep the env; heartbeat/close require it, but plain proposal/recap writes are permitted for non-dispatched agents.
