orchestration/tickets/T01-contracts/plan.md:798:    dispatcher_lock_path: str     # dispatcher_lock_path     PLAN_DISPATCHER_LOCK_PATH    "data/dispatcher.lock" (§7.1)
orchestration/tickets/T01-contracts/plan.md:811:Fail-safe dispatch flag (§7.1): a separate function, `read_dispatch_enabled(path: str | None, env) -> bool`, re-reads YAML+env fresh and returns `False` on ANY exception (missing file is not an error — defaults apply; a malformed file or unparseable value returns `False`). The dispatcher calls this every tick instead of trusting the startup `Config`.
