orchestration/tickets/T14-ui-foundation/plan-review-raw.txt:2389:orchestration/tickets/T09-server-shell/ticket.md:24:Self-smoke (scripted, not committed as tests — e2e items cover this later): boot under test mode on a temp DB; `GET /api/meta` 200; WS `?since=0` receives an event appended via `append_event`; `POST /api/test/set-now` changes the planning date returned by a probe; stale-claim rejection unit-exercisable by calling `require_claim` directly. ruff + mypy strict clean; existing unit suite stays green.
