codex
There is one clear frontend ledger omission: the plan removes `/runs`, but the ticket screen still fetches and renders it later in the file, not just the shared `runHistory` helper. I’m verifying whether that’s already covered by the plan’s “verify no caller” note or needs to be called out as a missed edit.
